            Must stay >= 4.33.0: sonar-ws 25.12 (used by integration tests via
            creedengo-integration-test / GCIRulesBase) generates code that
            references com.google.protobuf.GeneratedFile, which was only
            introduced in protobuf-java 4.33. Pinning to 4.31 used to break
            test-compile with "cannot access com.google.protobuf.GeneratedFile".
        -->
        <version.protobuf>4.33.0</version.protobuf>
        <sonarjava.version>8.23.0.42096</sonarjava.version>
